WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.330 --> 00:00:02.039
- It's nice to meet another
American Idol person.

00:00:02.039 --> 00:00:02.872
- I know.

00:00:02.872 --> 00:00:04.340
- It's funny, we've never met,

00:00:04.340 --> 00:00:08.170
but I feel like it doesn't
matter what season you're from or

00:00:08.170 --> 00:00:09.290
it's like a camp.

00:00:09.290 --> 00:00:11.240
Like it's sometimes
when you run into people

00:00:11.240 --> 00:00:12.240
- It is.
- I'm always like,

00:00:12.240 --> 00:00:13.220
oh, hey, we don't know each other,

00:00:13.220 --> 00:00:14.053
but we kind of do

00:00:14.053 --> 00:00:14.886
'cause we're the same.
- Well and it's

00:00:14.886 --> 00:00:18.470
you have a, like an
unspoken bond with everybody

00:00:18.470 --> 00:00:19.310
who does Idol because
- Yeah,

00:00:19.310 --> 00:00:20.143
it's like a connection.

00:00:20.143 --> 00:00:22.270
- Yeah 'cause it's like
nobody else understands

00:00:22.270 --> 00:00:23.890
what it's like to be on that show

00:00:23.890 --> 00:00:24.970
- Yeah.
- and then you meet people

00:00:24.970 --> 00:00:26.330
that you're like, you know

00:00:26.330 --> 00:00:27.917
exactly what I went through.
- Yeah.

00:00:27.917 --> 00:00:29.390
And what you just get thrown into,

00:00:29.390 --> 00:00:30.223
it's crazy.
- Yeah.

00:00:30.223 --> 00:00:31.056
- What season were you on?

00:00:31.056 --> 00:00:33.300
- It was on season nine.

00:00:33.300 --> 00:00:35.700
I always get confused
'cause it was in 2010.

00:00:35.700 --> 00:00:37.950
So, but I was one of the
youngest on my season.

00:00:37.950 --> 00:00:39.780
I was like 16, so.

00:00:39.780 --> 00:00:40.613
- Wow.

00:00:40.613 --> 00:00:43.030
- I went from singing like
at my high school talent show

00:00:43.030 --> 00:00:44.840
to then being thrust into the show.

00:00:44.840 --> 00:00:46.940
- Wow, I was 19, so I was
at least a few years older.

00:00:46.940 --> 00:00:47.950
That's young.
- Yeah.

00:00:47.950 --> 00:00:50.870
And I sang the same audition song as you.

00:00:50.870 --> 00:00:51.703
- Oh, "At Last?"

00:00:51.703 --> 00:00:52.536
- Yeah.

00:00:52.536 --> 00:00:53.369
- Oh my God.

00:00:53.369 --> 00:00:54.202
So here's the reason why I sang it is,

00:00:54.202 --> 00:00:56.020
I literally didn't know it was a TV show

00:00:56.020 --> 00:00:56.853
because it was the first season.

00:00:56.853 --> 00:00:57.960
I had no idea what I was auditioning for,

00:00:57.960 --> 00:00:59.196
I just thought it might pay

00:00:59.196 --> 00:01:01.481
and I was singing it at a wedding.

00:01:01.481 --> 00:01:04.100
and so I was like, I'll just
sing it 'cause whatever.

00:01:04.100 --> 00:01:05.290
- Well, and--
- And I love that song.

00:01:05.290 --> 00:01:06.150
- I love that song.

00:01:06.150 --> 00:01:06.983
- Yeah.

00:01:06.983 --> 00:01:09.913
- And I was like, I was the
young one with the old soul.

00:01:09.913 --> 00:01:12.330
- Yeah.
- And then when we got

00:01:12.330 --> 00:01:14.590
to the live shows the
judges kept telling me

00:01:14.590 --> 00:01:16.420
that they wanted me to be younger

00:01:16.420 --> 00:01:19.580
and in my head, I was like
young, who's young and fun?

00:01:19.580 --> 00:01:21.110
Kelly Clarkson.

00:01:21.110 --> 00:01:21.943
So--
- Oh, you sang,

00:01:21.943 --> 00:01:22.776
what did you sing?

00:01:22.776 --> 00:01:24.410
- I sang "Breakaway"

00:01:24.410 --> 00:01:27.491
and unfortunately it was
my worst performance.

00:01:27.491 --> 00:01:28.324
(laughing)

